## Worktree Routing

Source .github-project.env before creating a worktree. Use its ANT_TEAM_WORKTREE_ROOT value and create one worktree per issue:

```sh
source ./.github-project.env
git worktree add "${ANT_TEAM_WORKTREE_ROOT/#\~/$HOME}/__ISSUE_ID__" -b "__BRANCH_NAME__" "__BASE_BRANCH__"
```

Do not set core.worktree. Do not create a second project documentation tree in the repository.

